  "Each reading ran in a fresh signed-in local Codex session, reasoning effort low, shell and plugins disabled, with no API key. Native audio was off. The model got the anonymous first MCP view from an image client, including its images and measurements. The large Qwen waveform helper was off in both arms. The lightweight caption and speech paths stayed enabled.",
